(3982737, 567188, 67841, '<td valign="top">aw, you should have titled it "X"!<br/> <br/>Nice colors &amp; symmetry - nice lighting going on.  A neat shot, but lacking in oomph.  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'aw, you should have titled it "X"! Nice colors & symmetry - nice lighting going on.  A neat shot, but lacking in oomph.  << 6 >>', '2007-08-09 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982742, 567837, 67841, '<td valign="top">vertigo!  <br/> <br/>I don''t like what''s going on with the water &amp; shot seems to lack a subject beyond its own upside-down-ness.  There is a wee bit of leading lines going on with the poles &amp; lane divider but it is lost with this perspective.  &lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'vertigo!   I don''t like what''s going on with the water & shot seems to lack a subject beyond its own upside-down-ness.  There is a wee bit of leading lines going on with the poles & lane divider but it is lost with this perspective.  << 5 >>', '2007-08-09 00:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982743, 566002, 67841, '<td valign="top">Chicken-bats!</td>', 'Chicken-bats!', '2007-08-09 00:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982746, 566447, 67841, '<td valign="top">Oh very nice!  The wide angle (almost fish-eye maybe?) works so well here.  Nice colors &amp; arrangement of subject.<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Oh very nice!  The wide angle (almost fish-eye maybe?) works so well here.  Nice colors & arrangement of subject. << 7 >>', '2007-08-09 00:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982757, 567765, 67841, '<td valign="top">Interesting, though one could expect to see a lot of these in this challenge so you better bring your "A" game - as they say.<br/> <br/>I find myself wishing there was less lost at the top of the image as my eyes are drawn to it so much.  The image seems just a tad off balance horizontally &amp; overall is a little flat - though I s''pose such would be the nature of photographing a reflection.  I like the splash of color on the left.<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Interesting, though one could expect to see a lot of these in this challenge so you better bring your "A" game - as they say. I find myself wishing there was less lost at the top of the image as my eyes are drawn to it so much.  The image seems just a tad off balance horizontally & overall is a little flat - though I s''pose such would be the nature of photographing a reflection.  I like the splash of color on the left. << 5 >>', '2007-08-09 00:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982762, 565869, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing to look at.  Nice symmetry.  Boy it''s a puzzler to figure though isn''t it? (that''s a good thing in my book)<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Very pleasing to look at.  Nice symmetry.  Boy it''s a puzzler to figure though isn''t it? (that''s a good thing in my book) << 7 >>', '2007-08-09 00:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982771, 567237, 67841, '<td valign="top">The background seems to suggest that this wasn''t shot upside down, but even if it was such perspective doesn''t seem to be a key component of your composition.  Yes, I suppose the spider is considered upside down but I''d expect to se his feet up in the air to feel he was upside down, you know?</td>', 'The background seems to suggest that this wasn''t shot upside down, but even if it was such perspective doesn''t seem to be a key component of your composition.  Yes, I suppose the spider is considered upside down but I''d expect to se his feet up in the air to feel he was upside down, you know?', '2007-08-09 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982773, 567195, 67841, '<td valign="top">Soft &amp; flat, IMHO.  Might have been way more compelling in black &amp; white, though...<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Soft & flat, IMHO.  Might have been way more compelling in black & white, though... << 5 >>', '2007-08-09 00:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982775, 567972, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very interesting visual.  An even wider dof would have been nice to see.  &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Very interesting visual.  An even wider dof would have been nice to see.  << 7 >>', '2007-08-09 00:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982781, 567936, 67841, '<td valign="top">Curious, but unmotivated, IMHO.  Nice light, but lacks crispness.  &lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Curious, but unmotivated, IMHO.  Nice light, but lacks crispness.  << 5 >>', '2007-08-09 00:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982788, 567714, 67841, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... does make the viewer ask "How?", but technically falls a little short - kinda soft on focus, white balance is tooo white, composition is uneven, etc.</td>', 'Hmmm... does make the viewer ask "How?", but technically falls a little short - kinda soft on focus, white balance is tooo white, composition is uneven, etc.', '2007-08-09 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982794, 567249, 67841, '<td valign="top">This is a good one.  I expected to see quite a few of these perspectives in this challenge.  It''s so great how this one makes your eye hunt &amp; get it''s bearings!  All the little ''clues'' come together nicely in the end...<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'This is a good one.  I expected to see quite a few of these perspectives in this challenge.  It''s so great how this one makes your eye hunt & get it''s bearings!  All the little ''clues'' come together nicely in the end... << 8 >>', '2007-08-09 01:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982796, 567876, 67841, '<td valign="top">Flat &amp; a tad overexposed, but fun to look at!</td>', 'Flat & a tad overexposed, but fun to look at!', '2007-08-09 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982807, 567918, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed - very pleasant image (to me, this begs for black &amp; white). <br/> <br/>It''s good, just lacks the follow-through that the flipped images in this challenge have.  Those images add an element of viewer fun that give them more points in my book!  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nicely composed - very pleasant image (to me, this begs for black & white).  It''s good, just lacks the follow-through that the flipped images in this challenge have.  Those images add an element of viewer fun that give them more points in my book!  << 6 >>', '2007-08-09 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982811, 567854, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; simple - composition is very appealing as is the title.  &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nice & simple - composition is very appealing as is the title.  << 7 >>', '2007-08-09 01:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982816, 567734, 67841, '<td valign="top">Lacking in subject, way too busy &amp; dark as well.  My only advice is that it may have made an interesting abstract if it were desturated.  Sorry, but I can''t justify voting it higher... &lt;&lt; 3 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Lacking in subject, way too busy & dark as well.  My only advice is that it may have made an interesting abstract if it were desturated.  Sorry, but I can''t justify voting it higher... << 3 >>', '2007-08-09 01:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
