(3985363, 566005, 62187, '<td valign="top">The small size constraints in the challenges rarely do Aviation Photography justice. Thanks for trying. Good shutter work. What! I just noticed that this photo had to be ''Validated''. That''s just crazy. People can be so idiotic. For that, I''m bumping up the score I was gonna give you. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'The small size constraints in the challenges rarely do Aviation Photography justice. Thanks for trying. Good shutter work. What! I just noticed that this photo had to be ''Validated''. That''s just crazy. People can be so idiotic. For that, I''m bumping up the score I was gonna give you. Good luck to ya!', '2007-08-09 23:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985366, 567923, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo alone is a 10. For the challenge? I''m not sure I''m getting the ''Upside Down'' part.</td>', 'The photo alone is a 10. For the challenge? I''m not sure I''m getting the ''Upside Down'' part.', '2007-08-09 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
