(3985382, 567372, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice wardrobe &amp; lighting, but the pose &amp; composition I find lacking.  Personally I would have had her lay on her back, perhaps looking at the camera (we''d see her head upside down), for this challenge.  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nice wardrobe & lighting, but the pose & composition I find lacking.  Personally I would have had her lay on her back, perhaps looking at the camera (we''d see her head upside down), for this challenge.  << 6 >>', '2007-08-09 23:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
