(3985395, 567704, 62187, '<td valign="top">Love it! The lighting, angles and color. Perfect 10.</td>', 'Love it! The lighting, angles and color. Perfect 10.', '2007-08-09 23:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985396, 567767, 67841, '<td valign="top">I''m not even as picky as some, as I know macro shots of insects are so tough to focus, but I find that just as in human portraits, the eye should at least be within the DOF.  You''ve back focused a bit with this one which makes the eye wander.  Still a nice capture overall, tho''! &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'I''m not even as picky as some, as I know macro shots of insects are so tough to focus, but I find that just as in human portraits, the eye should at least be within the DOF.  You''ve back focused a bit with this one which makes the eye wander.  Still a nice capture overall, tho''! << 6 >>', '2007-08-09 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985397, 567249, 62187, '<td valign="top">You got me: 10!</td>', 'You got me: 10!', '2007-08-09 23:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985398, 566752, 67841, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at &amp; nice colors.</td>', 'Interesting to look at & nice colors.', '2007-08-09 23:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985406, 567563, 67841, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea, but god-awful lighting!  All your light is coming from the same direction as your view (on camera flash?) which flattens the image.  You end up with no texture, no depth to the image.  Side lighting would have been preferable here, IMO, with a less centered composition.  &lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Fabulous idea, but god-awful lighting!  All your light is coming from the same direction as your view (on camera flash?) which flattens the image.  You end up with no texture, no depth to the image.  Side lighting would have been preferable here, IMO, with a less centered composition.  << 5 >>', '2007-08-09 23:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985412, 567923, 58235, '<td valign="top">whats upside down?</td>', 'whats upside down?', '2007-08-09 23:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3985415, 567229, 67841, '<td valign="top">Ha ha - nicely titled.  The mirror is a nice touch, but that point is countered by the fact that it is surrounded by blown out white wall, so my gut tells me it would have been better if it were excluded from the composition.</td>', 'Ha ha - nicely titled.  The mirror is a nice touch, but that point is countered by the fact that it is surrounded by blown out white wall, so my gut tells me it would have been better if it were excluded from the composition.', '2007-08-09 23:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
