(3985456, 565964, 67841, '<td valign="top">Cute subject &amp; nice composition.  B&amp;W is good here, but maybe a boost in sharpness or contrast would brought some punch to the image.  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Cute subject & nice composition.  B&W is good here, but maybe a boost in sharpness or contrast would brought some punch to the image.  << 6 >>', '2007-08-09 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
