(3990587, 567810, 65234, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work for me compositionally.  The red things (cabinet and ... something) catch my eye but don''t repeat consistently enough to make an interesting pattern to me. And the globe is not a strong element because its color blends in to everything else.  Maybe if you had a spotlight on the globe and dimmer lighting elsewhere, plus a tighter crop?</td>', 'Doesn''t work for me compositionally.  The red things (cabinet and ... something) catch my eye but don''t repeat consistently enough to make an interesting pattern to me. And the globe is not a strong element because its color blends in to everything else.  Maybe if you had a spotlight on the globe and dimmer lighting elsewhere, plus a tighter crop?', '2007-08-12 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
