(3996773, 565170, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hi.  Coming back around to comment.  I just want to say this image is perfect for the challenge and a wonderful image outside of the challenge context.  Worthy of framing as is.<br/> <br/>Fortunately I have my own office, free from curious stares, so I can attempt to look at this right side up. :P I think this image is much stronger the way it''s currently presented.  It seems out of balance with the trees at the bottom.<br/> <br/>Well seen, and very well captured.  Enjoy your week on the front page of DPChallenge when the results are posted after rollover tonight.  You earned it!  :)</td>', 'Hi.  Coming back around to comment.  I just want to say this image is perfect for the challenge and a wonderful image outside of the challenge context.  Worthy of framing as is. Fortunately I have my own office, free from curious stares, so I can attempt to look at this right side up. :P I think this image is much stronger the way it''s currently presented.  It seems out of balance with the trees at the bottom. Well seen, and very well captured.  Enjoy your week on the front page of DPChallenge when the results are posted after rollover tonight.  You earned it!  :)', '2007-08-14 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
