(3998944, 565319, 68599, '<td valign="top">I''m happy it''s a PB but i was hoping to get a 6 in which i didn''t :( Anyways someone asked me how i did this shot well here it is nice and brief:<br/> <br/>Simply took a blue background (bristol board cheap stuff) and then took 2 small house lamps and laid them in front of a table to illuminate the background. Also put tissues over one of them to diffuse the glow a bit. The smoke in the water that created a nice movement for the fish, was actually unintentional as the water flow that hit the glass made that. Anywho i''m still wishing for that 6.</td>', 'I''m happy it''s a PB but i was hoping to get a 6 in which i didn''t :( Anyways someone asked me how i did this shot well here it is nice and brief: Simply took a blue background (bristol board cheap stuff) and then took 2 small house lamps and laid them in front of a table to illuminate the background. Also put tissues over one of them to diffuse the glow a bit. The smoke in the water that created a nice movement for the fish, was actually unintentional as the water flow that hit the glass made that. Anywho i''m still wishing for that 6.', '2007-08-15 01:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
