(3999604, 567714, 70689, '<td valign="top">Post Challenge: Pretty happy with this one, expected it to end a bit lower. I agree with any of the technical comments here and have a remake planned for the end of this week.<br/> <br/>For those who still wonder how it''s done; it is actually fairly simple. The glasses are filled with tea made to jello and the is turned (actualy, the camera) upside down. So three glasses are upside down, only one is bottom down.</td>', 'Post Challenge: Pretty happy with this one, expected it to end a bit lower. I agree with any of the technical comments here and have a remake planned for the end of this week. For those who still wonder how it''s done; it is actually fairly simple. The glasses are filled with tea made to jello and the is turned (actualy, the camera) upside down. So three glasses are upside down, only one is bottom down.', '2007-08-15 06:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
