(4001620, 566447, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by adone:</b></div><hr/><i> i like the pic...... but the idea is stolen ... have seen it 2 years ago.... in a gallery in germany.... sorry... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Really???  Funny that...I must remember not to go anywhere in case there are already ideas out there.<br/> <br/>Considering I have never been out of Australia...I doubt I could have ''STOLEN'' it!!!<br/> <br/>How about an apology now...!  You were quite willing to accuse me in front of everyone...now that you know you were false in your accusations...you should also aplogize in front of everyone.<br/> <br/>Language barriers or not....what you wrote was wrong...!<br/> <br/>********************<br/> <br/>Well it seems that your account has now been de-activated.  Hmmmm!!  Isn''t that interesting?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-15 16:43:48.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by adone: i like the pic...... but the idea is stolen ... have seen it 2 years ago.... in a gallery in germany.... sorry...   Really???  Funny that...I must remember not to go anywhere in case there are already ideas out there. Considering I have never been out of Australia...I doubt I could have ''STOLEN'' it!!! How about an apology now...!  You were quite willing to accuse me in front of everyone...now that you know you were false in your accusations...you should also aplogize in front of everyone. Language barriers or not....what you wrote was wrong...! ******************** Well it seems that your account has now been de-activated.  Hmmmm!!  Isn''t that interesting?', '2007-08-15 16:42:21.000000', '2007-08-15 17:43:48.000000', 0),
