(4004880, 567765, 77543, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who voted and left a comment. I''m extremely surprised to receive a ribbon for this, I thought it would finish somewhere in the middle of the pack. To date this is my highest score even though I think other pictures I''ve taken are better. But what do I know? Clearly not as much as you lot.</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who voted and left a comment. I''m extremely surprised to receive a ribbon for this, I thought it would finish somewhere in the middle of the pack. To date this is my highest score even though I think other pictures I''ve taken are better. But what do I know? Clearly not as much as you lot.', '2007-08-16 17:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
