(4006650, 567734, 24171, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments! I''ve really got to fix my problems w/darkness on my monitors... :\<br/> <br/>Those who were unsure of what the image actually was, it''s a shot down into a still pool, on a small creek. The leaves you see there are reflections of leaves above the pool and out of the shot. All natural lighting, allowing you to see to the bottom of the rock covered pool in some areas. It really wasn''t an image you can appreciate at the small size I submitted.<br/> <br/>Here''s a link to the image, full-res, it does look much better.<br/> <br/><a href="//flickr.com/photo_zoom.gne?id=1034865306&amp;size=l" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Full-Resolution Reflections</a> <br/> <br/>Also took <a href="//flickr.com/photo_zoom.gne?id=1034005291&amp;size=l" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this gorgeous shot</a>the same afternoon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-17 12:33:02.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments! I''ve really got to fix my problems w/darkness on my monitors... :\ Those who were unsure of what the image actually was, it''s a shot down into a still pool, on a small creek. The leaves you see there are reflections of leaves above the pool and out of the shot. All natural lighting, allowing you to see to the bottom of the rock covered pool in some areas. It really wasn''t an image you can appreciate at the small size I submitted. Here''s a link to the image, full-res, it does look much better. Full-Resolution Reflections  Also took this gorgeous shotthe same afternoon.', '2007-08-17 13:30:51.000000', '2007-08-17 13:33:02.000000', 0),
(4008145, 567945, 52169, '<td valign="top">Oh! I gave this a 10! I loved it. It was simple and pleasing. Good job. It should of been in the top 20.</td>', 'Oh! I gave this a 10! I loved it. It was simple and pleasing. Good job. It should of been in the top 20.', '2007-08-17 23:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4008504, 566447, 30807, '<td valign="top">Wow!<br/> <br/>Picture is great - very impressive. My brother was as cool about danger as she is - Me, I wouldn''t go near the edge without a safety harness and a parachute, never mind handstanding - such is life. Hope she doesn''t take it up for a living. Future venues for her could include the Grand Canyon?<br/> <br/>I am amazed she has the strength to do that - must be very slim and light. Me - I cracked a rib leaning over the back of a couch - but I weigh about 225 pounds, so no shock there!<br/> <br/>You have inspired me to diet - so well done with the first picture in your motivational photo series, and the best for future photos!</td>', 'Wow! Picture is great - very impressive. My brother was as cool about danger as she is - Me, I wouldn''t go near the edge without a safety harness and a parachute, never mind handstanding - such is life. Hope she doesn''t take it up for a living. Future venues for her could include the Grand Canyon? I am amazed she has the strength to do that - must be very slim and light. Me - I cracked a rib leaning over the back of a couch - but I weigh about 225 pounds, so no shock there! You have inspired me to diet - so well done with the first picture in your motivational photo series, and the best for future photos!', '2007-08-18 02:54:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4010495, 566393, 48954, '<td valign="top">cool shit yo</td>', 'cool shit yo', '2007-08-19 07:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4011239, 567810, 66597, '<td valign="top">Weird but cool. Too bad you were limited by basic editing on this - it would be most interesting without the pattern on the rug as a distraction, and if some of the highlights were toned down. But I like the risks you take in trying these types of shots - keep ''em coming!</td>', 'Weird but cool. Too bad you were limited by basic editing on this - it would be most interesting without the pattern on the rug as a distraction, and if some of the highlights were toned down. But I like the risks you take in trying these types of shots - keep ''em coming!', '2007-08-19 15:36:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4011247, 566600, 66597, '<td valign="top">Peter, I really like this. I was one of your higher scores. Would have been even higher with a little more negative space around the two background figures, but I also think it works very well as is. I''ve enjoyed your Frogner Park photos in general - what an inspiring place it is!</td>', 'Peter, I really like this. I was one of your higher scores. Would have been even higher with a little more negative space around the two background figures, but I also think it works very well as is. I''ve enjoyed your Frogner Park photos in general - what an inspiring place it is!', '2007-08-19 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
